  "ended_on_llm_error": true,
  "final_message": "<think>The dev build references `process.env.NODE_ENV`. I need to define `process` in the jsdom window, or build in production mode. Let me set `process` in the window before eval:\n\n```js\nwindow.process = { env: { NODE_ENV: \"production\" } };\n```\n\nBut React's dev build checks process.env.NODE_ENV at runtime \u2014 with \"production\" it uses the production bundle. Good. Let me also set `window.process` = globalThis.process? That would give process.env.NODE_ENV = undefined \u2192 React dev mode. Setting NODE_ENV=\"production\" is better.\n\nLet me add that.</think>\n\n",
